{
  "author": "Portal Suite",
  "content": "<section style=\"margin:0 0 22px;padding:18px 16px;border-left:5px solid #C9A227;background:#F7F3E8\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;color:#7A5B12;font-size:14px;font-weight:700\">Portal Suite</p><p style=\"margin:0;color:#142033;font-size:21px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4\">花旗：Keysight订单连续两季超20亿美元</p></section>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">这份<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">Citi</span>研究报告的核心判断并不复杂：Keysight Technologies在AI测试需求带动下，收入增长正在<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">加速</span>，而且这种势头至少能延续到下一财年。报告将目标报价从396美元上调至400美元，同时把<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">FY26</span>至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">FY28</span>的每股盈利预测上调了<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">13%</span>至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">14%</span>。更值得<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">注意</span>的是，报告把估值倍数从35倍下调至28倍，足以抵消估值调整的影响。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">先看Jul-Q（公司财年第<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">三季度</span>）的数字。总收入<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">18.46亿美元</span>，同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">37%</span>，环比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">7.5%</span>，而<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">Citi</span>和市场的预期都在<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">29%</span>左右。实际结果比预期高出约一个百分点，毛利率达到<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">69%</span>，营业利润率33.2%，也明显高于市场预期的28.3%。公司给出的下季度指引是收入19.3亿至19.5亿美元，同比增长36%至37%，这同样高于市场此前预期的28.7%。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">订单数据是这份报告最值得关注的信号。公司连续第二个季度录得超过<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">20亿美元</span>的订单，管理层认为需求在<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">FY27</span>仍然可持续。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">Citi</span>在报告里提到，客户的长期可见度在增加，订单漏斗持续扩大，这些表述比单季度的收入<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">超预期</span>更有信息量——它说明AI相关的测试需求不是一次性脉冲，而是正在变成结构性的订单流。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOVfibmUFicVb18R1WzzHFdldtsQrA4wVTnVWPriaia6kR9DiaR8m3g6z7tzpial0WT5Er3qrAJu0jAz4YJfJqtuaFgricof3blEoSdibb0/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">1. 毛利率与营业利润率同步<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">改善</span>，盈利质量高于收入增速</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">把利润表拆开看，Jul-Q的毛利率<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">69%</span>比<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">Citi</span>预期的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">67.3%</span>高出近两个百分点，营业利润率<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">33.2%</span>比预期高出近五个百分点。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">Citi</span>在报告中解释，这来自更高的产量、收购协同效应和产品组合优化。简单说，收入增长的同时，单位成本在下降，高毛利产品占比在提升。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">Citi</span>将<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">FY26</span>毛利率预期从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">68.5%</span>上调至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">69.3%</span>，<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">FY27</span>从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">67.6%</span>上调至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">68.7%</span>。营业利润率方面，FY26从29.6%上调至32.3%，FY27从29.6%上调至31.9%。这些调整幅度不小，说明Citi认为盈利能力的改善不是季度性波动，而是可持续的。</p>\n<section style=\"margin:18px 0;padding:13px 15px;background:#F1F8F4;border-left:4px solid #2F8F5B;color:#223044;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75\"><strong>KC评论：</strong> 先看毛利率从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">67.3%</span>到<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">69%</span>这个跳跃，它比收入<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">超预期</span>更难做到。收入增长可以靠订单集中释放，但毛利率提升需要产品结构、产能利用率和成本控制同时配合。我的理解是，AI测试设备的定制化程度高，客户对性能的敏感度高于价格，这给了Keysight定价空间。接下来更值得观察的是，当AI相关订单占比继续上升时，毛利率能否稳定在<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">69%</span>以上，还是会因为产品组合变化而回落。</section>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOWLrUz9suJjicN5docsia2TYHRHSoKTlqQw18LK0JemzeU2dZYA6IKIRtYicccmcZibWcw9RtiaRicKl9mGUVicAibjtNFprXBWzdr9ibA4/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 2\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">2. <span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">FY27</span>增长可见度来自订单能见度，而非单纯的需求假设</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">Citi</span>对<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">FY27</span>的收入预期是<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">79.61亿美元</span>，同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">12%</span>，高于此前预期的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">75.87亿美元</span>。这个上调幅度接近<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">4亿美元</span>，在单一财年的预测修正中不算小。报告明确提到，虽然<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">FY27</span>的同比基数会变高，供应仍可能成为增长的温和限制因素，但管理层表示AI需求没有节奏变化迹象。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">这里的关键不是\"AI需求强劲\"这个结论本身，而是<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">Citi</span>愿意为此上调预测的幅度。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOVksORpIX0VfIsibgtpYAjFzrLhHCV9LAN1UrWtduG9jI17Ng03GzUNKs4IX5h8icD12ThuVJlfapicH5V0drSR47chcCr7meNU3k/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 3\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:28px 0 0;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #D9DEE7;color:#8A93A3;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6\">For informational purposes only. Portions may be generated, translated, summarized, or edited with AI assistance based on source materials and may contain omissions or errors. Please verify independently. This is not investment, legal, tax, accounting, or other professional advice.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOXSZHDbJCdckDl11nvgm8s8ibB6hREb4JqlksKQuHicSE9PSBYRx5zx9MbhxahvS2gwsAx0L05V1hfpQaA9SjR7ibar5Vma3GXB50/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"Portal Suite\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;color:#A3ABB8;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;text-align:left\">Original report: 20-CITI-Keysight Technologies -KEYS.US- Raising</p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;padding:14px 16px;background:#EAF2FB;border-left:4px solid #2E6FB7;color:#152033;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;font-weight:600\">更新信息参见portal.example.invalid</p>",
